  .fact-box table { margin: 0; }
  .further-reading { background: rgba(88, 129, 87, 0.05); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 1rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
  .further-reading h2 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .verification { background: rgba(13, 78, 80, 0.04); padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent); font-size: 0.875rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .verification strong { color: var(--color-primary); }
</style>

<article>
  <div class="article-header">
    <h1>Eclipse Cannabis — Raymond Maine Dispensary</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Two-location Maine cannabis operator with the main dispensary on Route 302 in Raymond and a second storefront in Mechanic Falls</p>
  </div>

  <section class="fact-box">
    <h2>Eclipse Cannabis at a Glance</h2>
    <table aria-label="Eclipse Cannabis dispensary overview">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Fact</th><th scope="col">Details</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Operator</strong></td><td>Eclipse Cannabis Company</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Raymond Address</strong></td><td>1259 Roosevelt Trail, Raymond, ME 04071</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Mechanic Falls Address</strong></td><td>44 Pigeon Hill Road, Mechanic Falls, ME 04256</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Phone</strong></td><td>1-(207)-302-0034</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Raymond Hours</strong></td><td>Every day 8am-8pm (per operator's site)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Mechanic Falls Hours</strong></td><td>Mon-Thu 10am-7pm · Fri-Sat 8am-8pm · Sun 8am-6pm</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>License Type</strong></td><td>Per Weedmaps: Medical at Raymond. Confirm adult-use acceptance directly.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Notable</strong></td><td>Curbside pickup available. One of the better-rated Maine operators at 4.6+ stars</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Service Area</strong></td><td>Raymond, Windham, Casco, Naples, Sebago, Standish, Gray, Portland / Windham corridor</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Primary Sources</strong></td><td>eclipsemaine.com · Weedmaps</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>Eclipse Cannabis Company operates two Maine cannabis dispensary locations. The main storefront is at 1259 Roosevelt Trail (Route 302) in Raymond, the second at 44 Pigeon Hill Road in Mechanic Falls. The operator is one of the better-rated Maine dispensaries, with a 4.6+ star rating per the Weedmaps and Raymond dispensary guide listings.</p>
    <p>Route 302 (Roosevelt Trail) is the main east-west corridor through the Sebago Lakes Region, running from Portland / Windham through Raymond, Casco, and into Bridgton and Fryeburg. The Raymond location is well-positioned for visibility from the main highway.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Raymond Location</h2>
    <p><strong>Address:</strong> 1259 Roosevelt Trail, Raymond, ME 04071<br>
    <strong>Hours:</strong> Every day 8am-8pm (per operator's site)</p>
    <p>The Raymond location sits on the main commercial corridor through town. Raymond is in Cumberland County on the north side of Sebago Lake. The town's population of ~4,500 makes it a small market, but the Route 302 traffic flow and the proximity to Windham and Portland give Eclipse a wider effective service area than the town's size would suggest.</p>
    <p>Curbside pickup is available at the Raymond location per the Weedmaps listing — a useful amenity for medical patients with mobility constraints or anyone preferring a contactless experience.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Mechanic Falls Location</h2>
    <p><strong>Address:</strong> 44 Pigeon Hill Road, Mechanic Falls, ME 04256<br>
    <strong>Hours:</strong> Mon-Thu 10am-7pm · Fri-Sat 8am-8pm · Sun 8am-6pm</p>
    <p>The Mechanic Falls location serves the eastern Cumberland / western Androscoggin County corridor. Mechanic Falls is a small Androscoggin County town between Lewiston-Auburn and Norway-Paris. The Pigeon Hill Road location is a few minutes off Route 11 / Route 121.</p>
    <p>This second location gives Eclipse a two-county footprint covering the western Sebago Lakes / Windham corridor from the Raymond storefront and the Lewiston-Auburn / Oxford Hills corridor from the Mechanic Falls storefront.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Service Area</h2>
    <p>From the Raymond storefront:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Raymond</strong> (in town) — 5 min</li>
      <li><strong>Windham</strong> — 10 min south</li>
      <li><strong>Casco</strong> — 10 min north</li>
      <li><strong>Naples</strong> — 10 min north</li>
      <li><strong>Otisfield</strong> — 15 min north</li>
      <li><strong>Sebago</strong> — 15 min northwest</li>
      <li><strong>Standish</strong> — 15 min southwest</li>
      <li><strong>Gray</strong> — 15 min southeast</li>
      <li><strong>Portland</strong> (via Route 302) — 30-35 min</li>
      <li><strong>Bridgton</strong> — 15 min northwest</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How to Verify Before You Go</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Official site:</strong> <a href="https://eclipsemaine.com/">eclipsemaine.com</a></li>
      <li><strong>Weedmaps listing:</strong> <a href="https://weedmaps.com/dispensaries/eclipse">weedmaps.com/dispensaries/eclipse</a></li>
      <li><strong>Raymond guide:</strong> <a href="/guides/raymond-dispensary-guide">Town-level overview of Raymond dispensaries</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Bring a valid government-issued photo ID. Medical patients should also bring their Maine MMMP card.</p>
  </section>

